      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25f-perchlike-fishes-6-gobies/micropercops_swinhonis_en/",
      "html": "<p>One of the most beautiful new fish species of 2003 is this goby, which is rather widely spread in China, Korea and Japan. It can reach a maximum size of approx. 8 cm. They are peaceful fish.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25f-perchlike-fishes-6-gobies/micropercops_swinhonis_en/",
      "html": "<p>As no regular imports of this beautiful species are made from the spreading area, the currently available fish are German bred.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25f-perchlike-fishes-6-gobies/micropercops_swinhonis_en/",
      "html": "<p>They must not be kept too warm, in keeping with their subtropical origin. 18–22°C are ideal.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25f-perchlike-fishes-6-gobies/micropercops_swinhonis_en/",
      "html": "<p>They eat every frozen and live food of adequate size; after habituation many specimens also accept dry food.</p>"
    }
